{"id":"1ae7c37b2bb25594","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-homogeneous.md","title":"Homogeneous Set","display":"df-homogeneous — Homogeneous Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-homogeneous","aliases":["58-df-homogeneous"],"display":"df-homogeneous — Homogeneous Set","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-homogeneous"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-homogeneous</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-homogeneous — Homogeneous Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> (集合, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-set.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span> (arity)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(r\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span> (color set)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in r^{[X]^n}\">\\(c\\in r^{[X]^n}\\)</span> (coloring)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\\subseteq X\">\\(H\\subseteq X\\)</span> (candidate homogeneous subset)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Homogeneous}(H,c,X,n,r)\">\\(\\mathrm{Homogeneous}(H,c,X,n,r)\\)</span> (homogeneity predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的唯一基数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。 对集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 和序数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]^\\lambda\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\lambda\\}\">\\([A]^\\lambda\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\lambda\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]^{&lt;\\lambda}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|&lt;\\lambda\\}\">\\([A]^{&lt;\\lambda}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|&lt;\\lambda\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homogeneous} \\vdash \\mathrm{Homogeneous}(H,c,X,n,r) \\leftrightarrow n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land r\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land H\\subseteq X\\land c\\in r^{[X]^n}\\land\\exists i\\in r\\;\\forall a\\in[H]^n\\;(c(a)=i)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homogeneous} \\vdash \\mathrm{Homogeneous}(H,c,X,n,r) \\leftrightarrow n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land r\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land H\\subseteq X\\land c\\in r^{[X]^n}\\land\\exists i\\in r\\;\\forall a\\in[H]^n\\;(c(a)=i)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A subset <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\\subseteq X\">\\(H\\subseteq X\\)</span> is homogeneous for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c:[X]^n\\to r\">\\(c:[X]^n\\to r\\)</span> when <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> is constant on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[H]^n\">\\([H]^n\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Homogeneous sets are key in Ramsey theory.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X$ (集合, see [[../batch12/58-df-set.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|A|$ 为集合 $A$ 的唯一基数，使用 [[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]] 的基数函数。 对集合 $A$ 和序数 $\\lambda$，$[A]^\\lambda\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\lambda\\}$，$[A]^{<\\lambda}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|<\\lambda\\}$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"r\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"c\\in r^{[X]^n}","display":false},{"tex":"H\\subseteq X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Homogeneous}(H,c,X,n,r)","display":false},{"tex":"|A|","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"[A]^\\lambda\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\lambda\\}","display":false},{"tex":"[A]^{<\\lambda}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|<\\lambda\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homogeneous} \\vdash \\mathrm{Homogeneous}(H,c,X,n,r) \\leftrightarrow n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land r\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land H\\subseteq X\\land c\\in r^{[X]^n}\\land\\exists i\\in r\\;\\forall a\\in[H]^n\\;(c(a)=i)","display":true},{"tex":"H\\subseteq X","display":false},{"tex":"c:[X]^n\\to r","display":false},{"tex":"c","display":false},{"tex":"[H]^n","display":false}],"bytes":1317,"backlinks":[{"id":"f3e4e60b1fa0eaf2","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Homogeneous}$ (canonical predicate, see [[58-df-homogeneous]])"},{"id":"e97de9ee12fb78d4","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Homogeneous}:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (homogeneity predicate, see [[../batch07/58-df-homogeneous.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-638","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-homogeneous.md|58-df-homogen